<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome — Student Portal</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
  <style>
    body {
      background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--color-primary) 0%, var(--color-primary-dark, #34495e) 100%);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: var(--space-6);
    }
    .welcome-wrap { width: 100%; max-width: 680px; }
    .welcome-card {
      background: var(--card-bg, #fff);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 16px);
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
    }
    .welcome-hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: var(--space-8) var(--space-6) 0;
    }
    .welcome-logo {
      width: 64px; height: 64px; margin: 0 auto var(--space-4);
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--color-primary, #2c3e50);
      color: #fff;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    }
    .welcome-hero h1 { margin: 0 0 var(--space-2); color: var(--text-primary, #2c3e50); }
    .welcome-hero p.tagline { margin: 0 0 var(--space-6); color: var(--text-muted, #7f8c8d); }
    .welcome-img { width: 100%; max-height: 240px; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
    .welcome-body { padding: var(--space-6); }
    .welcome-body h2 { font-size: var(--text-lg, 1.05rem); margin: 0 0 var(--space-3); color: var(--text-primary, #2c3e50); }
    .welcome-body ul { margin: 0; padding-left: var(--space-5); display: grid; gap: var(--space-2); }
    .welcome-body ul li { font-size: var(--text-sm, .9rem); color: var(--text-secondary, #4a5568); line-height: 1.55; }
    .welcome-cta {
      padding: var(--space-6);
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light, #eef2f6);
    }
    .welcome-cta .btn { width: 100%; padding: 0.85rem 1rem; font-size: 1rem; text-decoration: none; }
    .welcome-note { margin-top: var(--space-3); font-size: var(--text-xs, .78rem); color: var(--text-muted, #7f8c8d); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="welcome-wrap">
    <div class="welcome-card">
      <div class="welcome-hero">
        <div class="welcome-logo">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"></path><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h1>Welcome to Student Portal! 🎓</h1>
        <p class="tagline">Your online classroom — lessons, assignments, scores, and messages, all in one place.</p>
      </div>

      <img src="/images/welcome.jpg" alt="Welcome to Student Portal" class="welcome-img" onerror="this.style.display='none'">

      <div class="welcome-body">
        <h2>What is this portal? 📚</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Lessons &amp; Learning Materials</strong> — notes, files, and videos posted by your teacher.</li>
          <li><strong>Assignments &amp; Activities</strong> — submit your answers, video links, or files on time.</li>
          <li><strong>Scores &amp; Feedback</strong> — see your results and your teacher's comments.</li>
          <li><strong>Messages</strong> — reach out to your teacher anytime.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 style="margin-top: var(--space-6);">📜 Code of Conduct</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Academic Integrity</strong> — always do your own work. No cheating, copying, or plagiarism.</li>
          <li><strong>Honesty</strong> — submit only your genuine outputs and truthful information.</li>
          <li><strong>Respect</strong> — treat your classmates and teachers with courtesy at all times.</li>
          <li><strong>Timeliness</strong> — submit assignments before the deadline; late submissions may not be accepted.</li>
          <li><strong>Responsible Use</strong> — this portal is for learning purposes only. Keep your account private and secure.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="welcome-cta">
        <a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary">Agree &amp; Continue →</a>
        <p class="welcome-note">By clicking continue, you agree to follow the guidelines above and use this portal responsibly.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>